# Cloudflare Pages URL rewrites / redirects
#
# Rules evaluated top-to-bottom; first match wins. The `:slug`
# placeholder matches any single path segment INCLUDING segments
# with dots, so a catchall rule /:slug will greedily swallow
# /falka.css, /falka-cms.js, etc. — DO NOT use a catchall here.
# List each live boat explicitly instead.

# --- Legacy 301 redirects for slugs renamed in Sanity ---
/falka-01        /vika-8           301
/falka-03        /vika-81          301

# --- Extension-less HTML files. Cloudflare's automatic HTML
# canonicalisation strips .html; these files have no extension so
# the canonicalisation can't trigger a redirect loop. _headers
# sets Content-Type: text/html for them. ---
/login.html      /login            301
/boat.html       /boat             301

# --- Live boat slugs → /boat template (rewrite, URL preserved) ---
# Each new live boat in Sanity needs a line added here. TODO: replace
# with a Cloudflare Pages Function that queries Sanity dynamically
# so this list maintains itself.
/vika-8          /boat             200
/falka-02        /boat             200
/falka-02-open   /boat             200
/vika-81         /boat             200
